I thought that was a load of hooey.

720
00:38:02,664 --> 00:38:05,132
As far as I can see, the glee club is nothing more

721
00:38:05,167 --> 00:38:07,134 than a place where a bunch of cowardly losers

722
00:38:07,169 --> 00:38:09,303 go to sing their troubles away,

723
00:38:09,337 --> 00:38:11,572 and delude themselves that they live in a world

