It takes

735
00:38:43,487 --> 00:38:46,355 a lot of bravery to look around you, and see the world,

736
00:38:46,390 --> 00:38:50,459 not as it is, but as it should be.

737
00:38:50,494 --> 00:38:53,062
A world where the quarterback becomes best friends

738
00:38:53,096 --> 00:38:55,131 with the gay kid,

739
00:38:55,165 --> 00:38:56,966 and the girl with the big nose ends up on Broadway.

740
00:38:57,000 --> 00:39:00,403
Glee is about imagining a world like that,

741
00:39:00,437 --> 00:39:03,906 and finding the courage to open up your heart

742
00:39:03,940 --> 00:39:06,242 and sing about it.

743
00:39:06,276 --> 00:39:09,211
That's what Glee Club is.

744
00:39:09,246 --> 00:39:12,782
And for the longest time,
I thought that was silly.

745
00:39:12,816 --> 00:39:15,551
And now, I think it's just about the bravest thing

746
00:39:15,585 --> 00:39:17,620 that anyone could do.

747
00:39:20,023 --> 00:39:23,159
I'm honored to be here to rededicate this theater

748
00:39:23,193 --> 00:39:25,094 the Finn Hudson Auditorium.

